      "kind": "absolute",
      "amount": 0.005
     }
    },
    "explanation": "$\\Big[\\frac{3x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^3}{3}\\Big]_0^3 = \\frac{27}{2} - 9 = \\frac{9}{2}$ square units.",
    "workedSolution": "1. $\\Big[\\frac{3x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^3}{3}\\Big]_0^3 = \\frac{27}{2} - 9 = \\frac{9}{2}$ square units."
   }
