        "description": "A1 obtains $\\sin x + x\\cos x$.",
        "marks": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     "modelAnswer": "$$\n\\frac{d}{dx}(x\\sin x) = 1 \\times \\sin x + x \\times \\cos x = \\sin x + x\\cos x\n$$"
